# 第 13 轮 · 创新 ARC 题（多逻辑组合）

> 参考题（20 道）：b7cb93ac, b1948b0a, a3df8b1e, 50aad11f, c4d067a0, fe45cba4, f8f52ecc, 1a6449f1, 6ca952ad, b9630600, 64a7c07e, 760b3cac, 2c181942, 2281f1f4, bf32578f, 16de56c4, a04b2602, 50c07299, 6cdd2623
>
> 提取的原语：
> - 操作类：拼合填充/packing, 旋转/rotate, 镜像/mirror, 重涂色/recolor, 射线延伸/ray_cast, 描边/trace_path, 裁剪/crop, 拼接/pack, 补全/complete, 缩放/scale, 移动/move, 擦除/erase, 连线/connect, 滑动/slide, 重力下落/gravity_drop, 平移/translate, 印章覆盖/stamp, 对接拼合/docking, 填充/fill, 周期填充/periodic_fill, 平移绘制/translate_draw, 平铺/tile, 连线/draw_line
> - 对象类：多连块碎片/polyomino_fragment, 紧凑矩形/compact_rectangle, 前景掩膜/foreground_mask, 孤立像素/isolated_pixel, 画布边界/canvas_boundary, 重复精灵体/repeated_sprite, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 缩略图/minimap, 色块网格/colored_block_grid, 碎片/fragment, 锚定物体/anchor_object, 矩形/rectangle, 同色连通分量/same_color_comp, 障碍墙/obstacle_wall, 矩形框/rectangular_frame, 内部区域/interior_region, 大前景对象/large_fg_object, 小标记对象/small_marker_obj, 空心矩形/hollow_rectangle, 走廊/corridor, 连通分量/connected_component, 精灵体/sprite, 半侧轮廓/half_outline, 对称轴/symmetry_axis, 边界点/boundary_dot, 伴随点/companion_dot, 前景对象/foreground_object, 对角线段/diagonal_segment, 方形网格/square_grid, 象限/quadrant
> - 空间关系类：无重叠拼合/non_overlap_packing, 互补拼合/complement_fit, 反射弹回/reflection_bounce, 最近邻匹配/nearest_neighbor_matching, 坐标映射/coordinate_mapping, 同色碎片拼成矩形/same_color_join, 同色分量依序连接/same_color_chain, 边框包围内容/border_encloses_content, 触底停止/stop_at_bottom, 最短可见间距/shortest_gap, 边界框决定偏移/bounding_box_determines_offset, 方向指示/dir_indication, 颜色匹配配对/color_match_pairing, 行列交叉/row_col_intersection, 对称/symmetry, 周期步长/periodic_step, 包含于边界框/in_bounding_box, 同反对角线/same_antidiagonal, 边界定位/boundary_pos
> - 条件/判断类：按面积降序放置/descending_area_place, 指定色统一替换/uniform_color_replacement, 对角遇边反射/diagonal_with_wall_reflection, 标记主轴方向排列/marker_dominant_axis_ordering, 已有块确认对齐/existing_blocks_confirm_alignment, 碎片触边锚不触边/frag_edge_anchor, 绕障碍最短路径/shortest_detour, 最大面积选取/largest_area_selection, 完整边框检测/complete_border_check, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 面积区分角色/area_determines_role, 最小生成树连接/min_spanning_tree, 重叠决定走廊宽度/overlap_corridor_width, 按自身宽度平移/shift_by_own_width, 标记指示放置侧/marker_placement_side, 对称消歧旋转/symmetry_disambiguates_rotation, 边缘标记笛卡尔积/edge_marker_cartesian_product, 内部行段填充/fill_interior_spans, 同余对齐/modular_alignment, 四象限各不同旋转/quadrant_rotation, 边界标记定贯穿线/boundary_marker_span, 长度递增/length_increment
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

