# 第 13 轮 · 创新 ARC 题（多逻辑组合）

> 参考题（20 道）：f3b10344, 6df30ad6, bbc9ae5d, 57aa92db, a6953f00, 6455b5f5, fc4aaf52, 4c3d4a41, 7d7772cc, 0c786b71, 1b2d62fb, 14b8e18c, 83302e8f, 20270e3b, 070dd51e, 9f27f097, d304284e, ac0c2ac3, 794b24be, 6e19193c
>
> 提取的原语：
> - 操作类：连线/draw_line, 重涂色/recolor, 填充/fill, 缩放/scaling, 补全/completion, 裁剪/crop, 计数/counting, 分割/split, 滑动/slide, 嵌入对齐/insert_and_align, 堆叠/stacking, 擦除/erase, 镜像/mirror, 拼接/concatenation, 逻辑运算/logical_op, 标记/marking, 洪泛填充/flood_fill, 对接拼合/docking, 印章覆盖/stamping, 射线延伸/ray_extend
> - 对象类：实心矩形/solid_rect, 桥接条/bridge_bar, 前景对象/foreground_object, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 色段/color_run, 精灵体/sprite, 模板/template, 指示区域/indicator_region, 角落区域/corner_region, 边缘行/edge_row, 封闭区域/enclosed_region, 分隔线/divider_line, 双色物体/bicolor_object, 框架槽/frame_slot, 凸起条/bar_with_projections, 参考像素/reference_pixel, 源像素/source_pixel, 原始网格/original_grid, 象限/quadrant, 二值掩模/binary_mask, 分隔条/separator_bar, 完整方块/complete_square, 角外像素/corner_outside_pixel, 格子框架/lattice_frame, 封闭背景区域/enclosed_bg, 连接点/connector_pixel, 轴对齐线段/axis_aligned_segment, 目标插槽/target_slot, 前景像素/foreground_pixel, 同心方环/concentric_ring, 箭头精灵体/arrowhead_sprite, 画布边界/canvas_boundary
> - 空间关系类：同色配对/same_color_pair, 对向间隙/facing_gap, 最近邻选择/nearest_neighbor_selection, 逐行递增/row_by_row_increment, 对齐匹配/alignment_match, 频率比较/frequency_compare, 面积比较/area_comparison, 对角邻接拼合/diagonal_adj_join, 列对齐/column_alignment, 对齐比较/aligned_comparison, 四象限对称/four_quadrant_symmetry, 逐像素对应/pixelwise_correspond, 角点邻接/corner_adjacency, 包含/containment, 对接对齐/docking_alignment, 共行或共列/shared_row_or_column, 形状匹配/shape_match, 周期排布/periodic_layout, 距离映射/distance_mapping, 朝向推断/dir_inference
> - 条件/判断类：最短间隙优先连/shortest_gap_first, 欧氏距离最小/minimum_euclidean_distance, 每行递增扩展/row_incremental_expand, 指示色定缩放对位/indicator_scale_align, 重复色或稀有色/repeat_or_rare, 极值区域分别涂色/extreme_regions_recolor, 颜色互换且偏移/color_swap_offset, 凸起匹配标记列/projections_match_columns, 颜色匹配定去向/color_match_dest, 逻辑或非合并/logical_NOR_combine, 完整方块才标记/only_complete_marked, 完整与缺损区异色/intact_broken_differ, 连接点颜色匹配/connector_color_match, 纵线覆盖横线/vertical_over_horizontal_priority, 翻转后粘贴/flipped_before_paste, 周期内指定位变色/cyclic_pos_recolored, 切比雪夫距离/chebyshev_distance, 中心对齐/center_aligned, 像素数转计数图/count_to_tally, 缺角指示方向/missing_corner_dir
