# 第 15 轮 · 创新 ARC 题（多逻辑组合）

> 参考题（20 道）：1f0c79e5, d687bc17, 6a11f6da, aee291af, 6e453dd6, 59341089, e88171ec, 4a21e3da, 5961cc34, 17b80ad2, 27a28665, 846bdb03, 8886d717, 136b0064, 6a980be1, 2dd70a9a, 4c7dc4dd, c920a713, b94a9452, a251c730
>
> 提取的原语（去重）：
>
> - 操作类：射线延伸(ray_extend), 重涂色(recolor), 移动(move), 擦除(erase), 透明叠加(transparent_overlay), 提取(extract), 去重筛选(uniqueness_filter), 平移(translate), 射线投射(ray_cast), 镜像(mirror), 拼接(concatenate), 填充(fill), 切割(cutting), 滑动(sliding), 级联激活(cascade_activation), 传播(propagate), 逐列填充(column_fill), 计数(counting), 分类(classification), 裁剪(crop), 连线(draw_polyline), 解码指令(decode_instructions), 平铺(tile), 寻路(pathfinding), 连线(draw_line), 类比推理(analogy_inference), 规则推断(rule_inference), 排序(sort), 重绘(redraw), 印章放置(stamp), 修补(repair)
> - 对象类：种子块(seed_block), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 边框(frame), 等高面板(equal_height_panel), 带框精灵体(framed_sprite), 前景杂波(foreground_clutter), 连通分量(connected_component), 分隔列(separator_column), 封闭区域(enclosed_region), 瓦片(tile), 最大实心矩形(largest_solid_rect), 前景对象(foreground_object), 控制像素(control_pixel), 端口(port), 底行标记像素(bottom_row_marker_pixel), 纵向色带(vertical_color_band), 掩码图案(mask_pattern), 角点(corner_cell), 矩形框(rect_frame), 图案块(motif), 主体对象(main_object), 边缘线(edge_line), 字形指令(glyph_instruction), 起始标记(start_marker), 矩形边框(rectangular_frame), 周期条纹(periodic_stripe), 标记条(marker_bar), 障碍像素(barrier_pixel), 起止标记(start_end_marker), 路径(path), 精灵体(sprite), 空心框(hollow_frame), 同心方框(concentric_frame), 边框矩形(bordered_rectangle), 锚点标记(anchor_marker), 前景矩形(foreground_rectangle)
