> - 条件/判断类：角位控制射线(corner_controls_ray), 颜色决定目标边(color_determines_side), 底层最优先(bottom_panel_highest_priority), 图案仅出现一次(pattern_once), 异常值选择(outlier_selection), 孔洞触发射线(hole_triggers_ray), 碰撞停止(collision_stop), 镜像与原始交替(mirror_original_alternation), 保留边框填内部(keep_border_fill_in), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 边界归属决定保留(border_ownership_keeps), 链式反应传播(chain_reaction_propagation), 底行标记选定列(bottom_marker_selects_column), 角点占用映射标签(corner_occupancy_to_label), 边色不符则翻转(mismatch_flip), 边缘指示方向(edge_indicates_direction), 编码映射(encoding_map), 条纹延伸全行列(stripe_full_span), 障碍触发转向(barrier_triggers_turn), 调色板匹配配对(palette_match_pairing), 最少色为锚点(rarest_color_as_anchor), 双色互换(two_color_swap)
