>
> 提取的原语：
> - 操作类：重涂色/recolor, 压缩/compress, 镜像/mirror, 路径绘制/path_drawing, 绕行/detour, 擦除/erase, 裁剪/clip, 填充/fill, 计数/counting, 重力下落/gravity_drop, 排序/sort, 透明叠加/transparent_overlay, 偏移阴影/offset_shadow, 平铺/tiling, 搜索/search, 射线延伸/ray_extend, 印章覆盖/stamp_overlay, 像素放大/pixel_scaling, 分割/split, 重分配/redistribute
> - 对象类：连通分量/connected_component, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 分隔线/divider_line, 色块区域/colored_region, 模板块/template_block, 象限/quadrant, 控制像素/control_pixel, 实心矩形/filled_rectangle, 边界标记/border_marker, 障碍条/obstacle_bar, 路径轨迹/path_trace, 中轴列/center_column, 前景像素/foreground_pixel, 条形段/bar_segment, 矩形容器/rect_container, 水像素/water_pixel, 盆地/basin, 障碍物/obstacle, 孤立像素/isolated_pixel, 面板/panel, 分隔行/separator_row, 阴影像素/shadow_pixel, 瓦片/tile, 同心正方形层/concentric_ring, 空心矩形区域/empty_rect_region, 背景空间/background_space, 轨迹线段/trail_segment, 引导条/guide_bar, 散布像素/scattered_pixel, 精灵体/sprite, 互补掩码/complement_mask, 柱状条/vertical_bar, 基线/baseline, 模板精灵体/template_sprite, 控制像素行/control_pixel_line, 实心矩形/solid_rect, 对角标记像素/diag_marker
> - 空间关系类：边邻接计数/edge_adjacency_count, 网格分区/grid_partition, 翻转对应/flip_correspond, 内部与边框/interior_vs_border, 阻挡/blocking, 相邻接触/adjacent_touch, 沿路径滑动/slide_along_path, 扫描序/scan_order, 位置对齐/positional_alignment, 偏移/offset, 嵌套层序/nesting_order, 轨迹交叉/trail_intersection, 投射到引导条/project_to_guide, 像素并集/pixel_union, 高度排序/height_ordering, 自身互补/self_complementary, 控制像素对应副本/control_pixel_to_copy, 角落对应/corner_correspond
> - 条件/判断类：邻接多数决/adjacency_majority_rule, 每区域折叠单像素/region_to_pixel, 控制定颜色映射/ctrl_color_map, 仅内部像素变色/only_interior_recolored, 障碍色决定绕行/obstacle_color_detour, 仅保留中轴/center_axis_only, 像素数转为条纹/pixels_to_stripes, 碰撞停止/collision_stop, 长轴决定扫描/longer_axis_determines_scan, 颜色循环分配/cyclic_color_assignment, 双面板背景交集/both_panels_background_intersection, 列环绕/column_wrapping, 色沿层序循环移/colors_cycle_by_nesting, 最大矩形填充/largest_rect_filled, 最小边长约束/min_side_constraint, 颜色决定运动方向/color_determines_motion, 交叉产生对角线/cross_spawns_diagonal, 投射落间隙则擦/erase_if_gap, 双掩码并集等三/two_union_eq_third, 槽位保持颜色/slot_retains_color, 前景位置放置瓦片/tile_at_foreground_positions, 标记色映射象限/marker_color_to_quad, 间距保持一致/gaps_preserved
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

