> - 条件类：精灵对准标记复制/sprite_at_marker, 双标记区域出前景/dual_marker_foreground, 角边内部分别涂色/corner_border_interior_recolored, 碰撞转向/collision_turn, 碰撞停止/collision_stop, 包围盒高决定柱高/bbox_height_bar_height, 锚点定位复制/anchor_positions_copy, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 返回较小者/return_smaller, 源色决定模板涂色/source_color_determines_template_recolor, 控制条周期延伸/control_periodic, 对角补全连接/diagonal_fill, 标记色传递给模板/marker_color_pass, 唯一色覆盖/unique_color_fill, 编码映射/encoding_map, 色块决定输出位置/color_direction_determines_placement, 宽度加倍延续周期/double_width_continuing_period, 标记色决定填充/marker_color_sets_fill, 追加封盖层/cap_layer_added, 顺时针到下一角/clockwise_next, 按面积降序/largest_to_smallest_area, 少数色替换/minority_replaced
