> - 条件类：交集差集分别着色(intersection_diff_colored), 宽度加倍拼接(width_doubling_concatenation), 最近边界方向(nearest_boundary_direction), 最短接触平移(minimal_contact_shift), 配对色映射(paired_color_mapping), 四象限折叠同画布(quadrants_fold_one), 锚角对角射线至边(anchor_diag_to_edge), 间距编码尾长(gap_distance_encodes_tail_length), 匹配槽位重涂(match_slot_recolor), 匹配间槽位另色(between_match_differ), 框内限定(frame_interior_only), 面板位决定层序(panel_layer_order), 框架色传递同形(frame_color_transferred_to_matching_empty), 颜色决定投影深度(color_det_depth), 跨框中线反射入内(reflect_centerline_in), 精灵精确拼合孔洞(sprites_exactly_tile_holes), 前景行带铺满画布(foreground_band_tiles_to_fill_canvas), 分色矩形桥接(split_rect_bridges_pixels), 门前停止(stop_at_gate), 图例编码转向(legend_encodes_turn), 碰撞停止(collision_stop), 编码映射(encoding_map), 边界内延续(continue_within_bounds)
