> - **空间关系类**：投射 perpendicular_cast, 双面板对齐 dual_panel_alignment, 邻域包围 neighborhood_surround, 行列带对齐 row_column_band_alignment, 众数颜色决定输出 majority_color_out, 对齐 alignment, 逆序扫描 reverse_scan, 逐步推进 stepwise_advance, 长度即周期 length_as_period, 列范围包含 column_span_contains, 标记在对象上方 marker_above_object, 双轴反射对称 biaxial_reflection_symmetry, 形状匹配孔洞 shape_matches_hole, 从臂端发射 emit_from_arm_end, 内部包含 interior_containment, 标记归属区域 marker_in_region, 按数量排序 count_ordering, 同行列对齐 row_col_aligned, 朝向映射 orientation_mapping
> - **条件/判断类**：命中处印标记 stamp_at_hit, 任一前景即输出 either_foreground_yields_output, 异常值选择 outlier_selection, 密集带检测 dense_band_detection, 忽略干扰项 ignore_distractors, 仅保留边框包围盒 keep_frame_bbox, 双面背景处标记 mark_both_bg, 空行丢弃 empty_rows_discarded, 遇障碍则绕行 detour_on_obstacle, 近者优先 nearest_first_priority, 控制色决定填色 control_fill_color, 标记朝向编码颜色 marker_orientation_encodes_color, 标记遮挡区域 marker_occludes_region, 旋转翻转不变 rotation_flip_invariant, 遇前景终止 stop_at_fg, 射线覆盖交叉点 rays_overwrite_cross, 含空洞对象重涂 objects_with_holes_recolored, 最多标记区胜出 max_marker_wins, 缺口方向决定射线 gap_direction_determines_ray, 忽略非正方形 ignore_non_square, 缺角决定目标象限 missing_corner_determines_quadrant, 相邻标记间填充 fill_between_markers
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

