> **空间关系类**：颜色配对/color_pairing, 邻接/adjacency, 邻域禁区/neighbor_exclusion, 反向投射/opposite_direction, 边界/boundary, 对角线对齐/diagonal_alignment, 对角线上阻挡/on_diagonal_blocking, 对角线偏移复制/diagonal_offset_copy, 逐色独立变换/per_color_transform, 归一化形状比对/normalized_shape_matching, 行列对齐/row_col_align, 锚点对齐/anchor_alignment, 对侧放置/opposite_place, 对角邻接/diagonal_adjacency, 连通可达/connectivity_reachable, 面积递减嵌套/area_descend_nest, 对称轨道/symmetry_orbit, 距离排序/distance_ordering
>
> **条件/判断类**：标记色匹配目标位/marker_color_matches_dest, 特定标记触发镜像/marker_triggers_mirror, 指示定镜像与色/indicator_sets_axis_color, 唯一安全路径/unique_safe_path, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 首个障碍/first_obstacle, 线段定裁剪列范围/lines_set_crop_columns, 扩展含角标行/row_includes_corner_markers, 阻挡点发射正交线/blocker_emits_orthogonal_line, 画布加倍/canvas_doubling, 包围盒内翻转/flip_within_bbox, 邻接触发对角溅射/adjacency_triggers_diagonal_splash, 固定步长移动/fixed_step_move, 匹配模板则重涂/recolor_on_match, 对齐像素投射矩形/aligned_pixel_to_rect, 碰撞停止/collision_stop, 标记编码位置/marker_encodes_position, 时钟指针编码角度/clock_hand_encodes_rotation, 凸耳决定镜像轴/tab_determines_axis, 颜色按方位定/color_by_orient, 指示决定方向色/indicator_dir_color, 平铺后对角涂色/diagonal_marked_after_tiling, 种子色标记填充/seed_color_labels_fill, 同轨道色填补损坏/orbit_mate_restores_damage, 标记决定拉伸终点/marker_determines_stretch_endpoint, 轴色决定旋转/axis_color_determines_rotation, 角落对齐嵌套/corner_aligned_nest
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

