> - 空间关系类：尾部朝向决定射出(tail_determines_emission), 对角邻接(diagonal_adjacency), 包围框包含(bbox_containment), 颜色匹配锚点(color_match_anchor), 逐步推进(stepwise_advance), 周期调度(periodic_schedule), 最近角距离(nearest_corner_dist), 逐步平移(stepwise_translation), 边界可达性(edge_reachability), 朝向编码方向(orientation_encodes_direction), 两点直线路径(straight_two_point), 邻接侧决定方向(adjacency_side_determines_dir), 位置对应颜色(position_to_color), 内部与外部沟槽(interior_vs_exterior_gutter), 曼哈顿路径(manhattan_path), 仅对角邻接(diagonal_only_adj), 中心展开(center_expansion)
> - 条件/判断类：像素数守恒(pixel_count_conservation), 颜色异常值选择(outlier_color_selection), 四角固定配色装饰(fixed_color_diagonal_corner_decoration), 像素替为固定模(pixel_replaced_by_stencil), 按原色区分涂色(recolor_by_origin), 异色包含则删(delete_if_contained_by_other_color), 边缘位置决定轴(edge_position_determines_axis), 循环迁移(cyclic_migration), 预测下一帧(predict_next_frame), 曼哈顿距离最小(min_manhattan), 颜色数决定尺寸(color_count_size), 拓扑分类(topological_classification), 碰撞变色规则(collision_recolor_rule), 固定步长平移(fixed_step_shift), 不覆盖源对象(preserve_source_object), 缺失位补色(fill_missing), 按边界框内外分色(color_by_bounding_box_membership), 对角邻接背景着色(diagonal_bg_color), 折线连接(L_path_connection), 数量决定输出宽(count_determines_width)
